toonish-ui bundles three typefaces, copied unmodified from the @fontsource packages
(Latin subset, woff2). Each is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
https://openfontlicense.org

- Bangers, by Vernon Adams
- DM Sans, by Colophon Foundry and Indian Type Foundry
- Space Grotesk, by Florian Karsten

No Cuphead art, fonts or traced shapes are used.
